IMAPStore mailbox-remote
Host imap.mailbox.org
User sebastiano@tronto.net
PassCmd "cat ~/.ssh/mailbox.org"
TLSType STARTTLS

MaildirStore mailbox-local
Path ~/mail/
Inbox ~/mail/INBOX
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel mailbox
Far :mailbox-remote:
Near :mailbox-local:
Patterns * !Archives
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *
